              "text": "ಅಭಿಮಾನ — abhimāna — \"pride; fond regard\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಮ್ಮ ಭಾಷೆಯ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ನಮಗೆ ಅಭಿಮಾನ ಇದೆ. namma bhāṣeya bagge namage abhimāna ide. We are proud of our language."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Warm pride in what you love; ಅಭಿಮಾನಿ is a fan."
            }
          ]
        },
