              "text": "ಅಹಂಕಾರ — ahaṅkāra — \"arrogance; conceit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಣ ಬಂದ ಮೇಲೆ ಅವನಿಗೆ ಅಹಂಕಾರ ಬಂದಿತು. haṇa banda mēle avanige ahaṅkāra banditu. Once the money came, he grew arrogant."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From ಅಹಂ, I, and ಕಾರ, making: making everything about \"I\"."
            }
          ]
        },
